# Copy to .env.local for local development.
#
# Settings (URLs, model, timeouts, the local dev user…) live in config/:
# common.ts, plus local.ts or prod.ts. `next dev` and tests run as local,
# production builds and `next start` as prod. This file is only for secrets;
# next.config.ts refuses to start a server that's missing one it needs.

# Prism's own database (see docker-compose.yml).
DATABASE_URL=postgres://prism:prism@localhost:54329/prism

# The gateway sends X-User-Id and X-Gateway-Secret on every request.
# Required in prod (32+ characters). Leave unset locally to skip the
# check and act as config/local.ts's dev user (or whatever X-User-Id a
# request sends).
# GATEWAY_SHARED_SECRET=

# Secret storage. When KMS_KEY_ID is set, keys are sealed with AWS KMS
# (not implemented yet). Unset locally: keys are stored unencrypted, which
# prod refuses.
# KMS_KEY_ID=
